  "description": "Microphone capture for ordinary .NET. OpenAlMicrophoneCapture opens a named OpenAL 1.1 capture device through OpenTK.Audio.OpenAL. VirtualMicrophoneCapture supplies in-process PCM and does not open a device. Linux and Windows CI load OpenAL and reject an explicit invalid device name. That is not a physical recording. macOS is not a supported claim. The native library is not included.",
